/-!
# SGP01 (SL) and SGP02 (RA) on the boundary family (lane B-PORT-SLIM, G1b)

GENERATED by `build-logs/scratch/B-PORT-SLIM/gen_g1.py` (job `rawrow`) from
`Collapse/LocalExport/LocalChartFamilyApplications.lean` (`SlimCentre.cutoff_eq_one`),
`Fibration/ActualSlimRawAlignment.lean` (sections `Actual`, `Row`) and
`Collapse/LocalExport/LocalChartPacketsValueApplications.lean` (`slim_value_sgpRaw`), with
`portlib.GLOBAL` (`LocalChartFamily(Q)` → `LocalPacketsOnB … U₁ U₂ Ue₁ Ue₂`, `SlimCentre` →
`SlimCentreOn`, `coord` → `coord_BCG2`, `cutoff` → `cutoff_BCNT`, complete σ-compact carrier) and
the suffix `_BAUGP`.

* `SlimCentreOn.cutoff_eq_one_BAUGP`, `sgpSlimList_mem_self_BAUGP`, `sgpSlimList_bounds_BAUGP`
  (SGP01's (SL): `.99 < s_j < 1.01`, `d(i, j) < 2Lρ(i)`), `sgp02_reference_tests_BAUGP`,
  `sgp02_row_BAUGP` (SGP02's (RA): one sign per listed chart, thresholds `Lc, η₀` first, then EVERY
  boundary family), `LocalPacketsOnB.slim_value_sgpRaw_BAUGP`.

Port differences (not token substitutions): FC18's slim support row is read directly from
`SlimFamilyOn.tsupport_cutoff_subset_BCNT` (closed: `fc18_slim_row`); the curvature buffer is used at
the slim centre `i ∈ U₁` (`(Q.slim.centres_subset hi).1`), the stratum is the second conjunct of the
